# Copy to .env if you prefer a file over shell exports. The service does not
# read .env itself; use your process manager (systemd EnvironmentFile, Task
# Scheduler, docker --env-file) or export these before starting.

# Where data lives, when it is not the repository root.
# BUDDY_ROOT=/srv/buddy-api

# Public origin printed on the key page. Leave empty to derive it from the
# request (recommended when the dashboard and API share a domain).
# BUDDY_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://api.example.com

# Gateway and dashboard wiring.
# BUDDY_GATEWAY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3190
# BUDDY_GATEWAY_PORT=3190
# BUDDY_DASHBOARD_PORT=3191

# Third-party helper and its peers (see README "Phụ thuộc ngoài").
# BUDDY_WORKBUDDY_HELPER=/opt/workbuddy/host-heartbeat-vU86u9aU.js
# BUDDY_WORKBUDDY_HELPER_SHA256=
# BUDDY_DSH_NODE_MODULES=/opt/dsh/node_modules
# BUDDY_DSH_ATOMIC_WRITE_SHA256=
# BUDDY_DSH_HOME_PATHS_SHA256=

# Desktop capture (Windows only).
# WORKBUDDY_AI_AUTH_FILE=%LOCALAPPDATA%\CodeBuddyExtension\Data\Public\auth\workbuddy-desktop-ai.info
# WORKBUDDY_AI_ELECTRON_BIN=%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\WorkBuddyAI\WorkBuddyAI.exe
